    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you're supposed to say that. it's the script. but it doesn't change the reality. it's not just a \"bad phase\" or a mood. it feels like the engine has actually stopped. like i've fulfilled my purpose and now i'm just a ghost haunting my own life. what's the point of trying to find a \"professional\" to fix something that's fundamentally just... finished?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
